### ================================================================
### GUEST WORKFLOW — BUKTI E2E: TAMU PESAN & LACAK TANPA LOGIN
### ================================================================
### Tujuan  : membuktikan satu rangkaian — tamu scan QR → lihat menu →
###           pesan → polling status → dibayar kasir → sesi ditutup,
###           SEMUA tanpa tamu punya akun/token login.
### Kontrak : API_CONTRACT.md §L2 (guest dining), §5.3 (permukaan publik)
###
### Prasyarat:
###   1. App jalan di {{baseUrl}} (localhost:8081), DB fresh (drop-create).
###   2. Ada minimal 1 meja (POST /tables di dining.http) dan data menu
###      dev (menuId 1/2, modifierOptionId 13 dipakai di sini).
###      CATATAN SEED: menuId 1 & 2 wajib modifier Size (option 13=Regular).
###   3. Jalankan step BERURUTAN dari atas ke bawah. Setiap ID (dining,
###      order, invoice) harap disesuaikan dengan hasil run lo.
###   4. Copy guestToken + guestCode dari response STEP 0 ke environment
###      (guestToken / guestCode di http-client.env.json).
###
### Yang DIBUKTIKAN di akhir file (checklist §CHECKLIST):
###   [G1] Sesi meja diekspos ke tamu via token + kode
###   [G2] Tamu anonim bisa menambah order (tanpa login, tanpa customerId)
###   [G3] Anti-spoof: customerId yang diinject tamu diabaikan server
###   [G4] Tamu bisa POLLING status sesi + isi order-nya (items[])
###   [G5] TokenReusable: token sama dipakai berkali-kali dalam satu sesi
###   [G6] Polling tetap hidup setelah sesi CLOSED (GET 200, POST ditolak)
###   [G7] Member login bisa ikut serta lewat /my/dinings (identitas dari JWT)
###   [G8] Member menemukan sesinya TANPA scan QR (GET /my/dinings)
### ================================================================


### ================================================================
### PERSIAPAN (staf) — sekali di awal
### ================================================================

### STEP 0: Staf buka sesi meja (guestToken + guestCode ada di response)
### → copy guestToken ke {{guestToken}}, guestCode ke {{guestCode}}
### [G1] Dinings — catat diningId dari response
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableId": 1
}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 1 — TAMU MELIHAT MENU (publik, tanpa login)
### ================================================================

### STEP 1: Tamu browse menu (endpoint publik — tidak butuh Authorization)
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus?size=50

### STEP 1b (opsional): kategori menu juga publik
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus/categories

### STEP 1c (opsional): detail satu menu (publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus/1


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 2 — TAMU MEMBUKA SESI & PESAN PERTAMA
### ================================================================

### STEP 2: Tamu buka halaman sesi dari QR (resolve by token)
### Ekspektasi: 200, status OPEN, invoiceStatus null, orders []
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}

### STEP 2b (fallback): QR gagal scan → resolve via kode 6 digit
### Ekspektasi: 200, payload sama dengan STEP 2 (hanya sesi OPEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/by-code/{{guestCode}}

### STEP 3: Tamu pesan (ANONIM — tanpa header Authorization sama sekali)
### Ekspektasi: 201, response = status sesi terbaru (sudah berisi order pertama)
### [G2]
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Tamu Meja 1",
    "notes": "Pedas level 2, es terpisah",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 14 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 3 — TAMU POLLING STATUS (inti dari "track")
### ================================================================
### FE tamu disarankan GET ini tiap 5–10 detik selama sesi berjalan.
### Perubahan yang terlihat antar poll:
###   - orders[].status : CREATED → CONFIRMED → PREPARING → READY → COMPLETED
###   - invoiceStatus   : null → OPEN → PARTIALLY_PAID → PAID
###   - totalPrice      : naik setiap order baru masuk
### [G4]

### STEP 4: Poll #1 — setelah staf confirm (jalankan STEP 8 dulu bila mau lihat perubahan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}

### STEP 4b: Poll #2 — setelah dapur prepare/ready (STEP 9/10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 4 — TAMU PESAN LAGI (token yang sama, bukti reusable)
### ================================================================

### STEP 5: Tamu tambah order kedua — token TIDAK berubah sepanjang sesi
### Ekspektasi: 201; di STEP 4b berikutnya orders[] bertambah jadi 2
### [G5]
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Tamu Meja 1",
    "notes": "Round 2",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 14 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### STEP 5b (ANTI-SPOOF): tamu mencoba menyelundupkan identitas member
### Ekspektasi: 201 (bukan error) — field customerId TIDAK ADA di kontrak
### GuestOrderRequest, diabaikan server; order tersimpan dengan customerId NULL.
### [G3]
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 7,
    "customerName": "Tamu Meja 1",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 14 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### STEP 5c: Bukti anti-spoof dari sisi staf — cari order dari STEP 5b di
### daftar order staf: customerId harus NULL meski body tamu mengirim 7
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?sort=createdAt,desc&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 5 — STAF/KITCHEN MEMPROSES (identitas staf, bukan tamu)
### ================================================================

### STEP 8: Confirm order pertama (bila step sebelumnya sudah jalan, sesuaikan orderId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 9: Prepare (bisa dilakukan role KITCHEN via /kitchen/orders + order.mark.preparing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 10: Ready → di poll tamu berikutnya status berubah READY
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 10b: Complete (waiter mengantar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 6 — TAGIHAN & PENUTUPAN SESI (kasir)
### ================================================================

### STEP 11: Kasir lihat invoice sesi (invoice dining terbit otomatis saat order pertama)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?diningId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 12: Bayar invoice (amount kosong = lunas penuh)
### → invoiceStatus di poll tamu berubah jadi PAID
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "CASH-GUEST-001"
}

### STEP 13: Tutup sesi — guard: semua order terminal & invoice lunas
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 7 — TRACKING SETELAH SESI DITUTUP
### ================================================================

### STEP 14: Tamu masih bisa MELIHAT riwayat sesi (GET tetap 200)
### Ekspektasi: status CLOSED, invoiceStatus PAID, seluruh orders[] utuh
### [G6]
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}

### STEP 14b: Tapi tidak bisa menambah order lagi (400 "closed")
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}

### STEP 14c: by-code ikut mati setelah close (hanya sesi OPEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/by-code/{{guestCode}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 8 — VARIAN MEMBER (login, tanpa QR)
### ================================================================
### Register customer di customer.http → login di auth.http →
### simpan accessToken ke {{customerToken}}.

### STEP 15: Member ikut pesan di sesi yang sama — identitas dari JWT,
### bukan dari body (GuestOrderRequest tidak punya customerId)
### Ekspektasi: 201
### [G7]
POST {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "",
    "notes": "Ikut sesi, dari member",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}

### STEP 15b: Member menemukan sesi TANPA scan QR — menutup jalan buntu /my
### Catatan: sesi di TAHAP 6 sudah CLOSED; pakai ?status=CLOSED untuk melihatnya.
### Untuk melihat default (OPEN), ulangi alur ini di meja lain dengan member yang sama.
### [G8]
GET {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings?status=CLOSED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### STEP 15c: Deep-link member ke tampilan tamu — payload sama dengan guest
GET {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### ================================================================
### NEGATIVE SUITE — penolakan yang diharapkan
### ================================================================

### Token salah (404 generik "Session not found" — tidak membocorkan apa pun)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/wrongtoken123

### Kode salah (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/by-code/000000

### Items kosong (400 "Order must have at least 1 item")
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": []
}

### customerName > 50 char (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Nama panjang sekali loh ini melebihi lima puluh karakter deh sela",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}

### menuId tidak ada (404 menu not found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 9999, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}

### Sesi lunas: order setelah PAID (400 "Sesi ini sudah lunas (INV-...)")
### → jalankan SETELAH STEP 12 pada sesi yang masih OPEN (pakai meja lain
###   bila sesi utama sudah ditutup di STEP 13)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}

### Member tanpa profil customer memakai /my (403 "Customer profile not found...")
### → pakai {{token}} staf (mis. admin@rascal.id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}


### ================================================================
### CHECKLIST — centang setelah run
### ================================================================
### [G1] STEP 0  : response POST /dinings berisi guestToken + guestCode
### [G2] STEP 3  : 201 tanpa header Authorization
### [G3] STEP 5b : 201 dengan customerId injected; STEP 5c: customerId NULL
### [G4] STEP 4  : orders[] berisi orderNumber, status, totalPrice, items[]
### [G5] STEP 5  : order kedua masuk ke sesi yang sama via token yang sama
### [G6] STEP 14 : GET 200 (status CLOSED) setelah close; 14b POST ditolak
### [G7] STEP 15 : member order tanpa mengirim identitas di body
### [G8] STEP 15b: sesi muncul di GET /my/dinings milik member
###
### Kalau 8/8 tercentang → workflow "guest order & track" TERBUKTI
### end-to-end dengan kode saat ini, tanpa perubahan BE tambahan.
